  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "現代漢語詞彙與句法",
    "sub_ename": "MODERN CHINESE VOCABULARY AND SYNTAX",
    "describe_ch": "本課程首先介紹現代漢語詞彙與句法的基礎理論知識；繼而從社會文化的角度探討現代漢語詞彙與句法在生活上的應用；終而引領學生透過客觀的現代漢語知識，分析現代文學作品的詞彙與句法風格，學以致用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course first introduces the basic theoretical knowledge of modern Chinese vocabulary and syntax; then discusses the application of modern Chinese vocabulary and syntax in daily life from the perspective of social culture; finally leads students to analyze the vocabulary and the vocabulary of modern literary works through objective modern Chinese knowledge Syntactic style, apply what you have learned.",
